{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34004","headline":"访寂上人不遇 · 皮日休","name":"访寂上人不遇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何处寻云暂废禅，客来还寄草堂眠。\n桂寒自落翻经案，石冷空消洗鉢泉。\n炉里尚飘残玉篆，龛中仍鏁小金仙。\n须将二百签回去，得得支公恐隔年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34004.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34004","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}